id: searx-published-consumer-isolation
title: Verify published consumers outside the source checkout
description: Run exact-version npm and Bun consumer checks from an isolated directory so the local package cannot shadow registry resolution.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[5]: bun,npm,recovery,regression,release
created_at: "2026-07-21T18:34:27.322Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-21T18:35:55.119Z"
deadline: "2026-07-22T18:34:29.978Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-21T18:35:52.713Z"
author: codex-release-agent
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: npm exact-version execution runs outside the checkout; Bun exact-version execution runs outside the checkout; Existing-tag recovery skips republish and creates the GitHub Release
definition_of_ready: The exact commands pass from an unrelated directory and fail only from the package source checkout.
parent: searx-repo-health-2026
reviewer: repository-owner
risk: high
confidence: 100
sprint: 2026-07-release-automation
release: next
reporter: codex-release-agent
severity: high
environment: Post-publication npm and Bun consumer verification
repro_steps: From the package checkout run npm exec with --package searxng-cli at the current version and invoke searxng; repeat from an unrelated directory.
resolution: Published consumer verification now uses isolated temporary working directories and asserts both outputs contain the exact release version.
expected_result: "Idempotent recovery skips publication, verifies npm and Bun consumers, and creates the GitHub Release."
actual_result: Local isolated npm and Bun executions both pass for 2026.7.21; protected recovery verification will run after merge.
affected_version: v2026.7.21 release verification
component: release
regression: true
customer_impact: Publication succeeds but workflow recovery cannot create the GitHub Release until exact-version verification is isolated.
files[3]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project,Run recovery-compatible exact-version checks under runner temporary storage
  scripts/release/verify-published-release.mjs,project,Isolate local exact-version verification from the source checkout
  tests/unit/release-automation.test.ts,project,Enforce isolated npm and Bun verification contract
tests[3]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  "bun run test:release",project,180
  "docker run --rm -v \"$PWD:/repo:ro\" -w /repo rhysd/actionlint:latest -color .github/workflows/release.yml",project,120
  node scripts/release/verify-published-release.mjs --version 2026.7.21,project,180
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
