close_reason: "Moved npm and Bun exact-version execution outside the package checkout; both resolve and execute searxng-cli 2026.7.21, release contracts pass, and Actionlint is clean."
body: "The published package and Bun execution succeeded, but npm exec inside the package source checkout treated the local project as satisfying its own package request while no self-installed bin existed. The identical exact-version command succeeds outside the checkout."
